# Two pistol shots take a third of a target's shield each; the shield is
# stunned for six seconds after the last (it does not come back), then
# recharges in four, to full; a shot then takes it down again.
scenario pistol_shield
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 81.0 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/pistol/pistol
ticks 520
input 0 520 pitch=-0.13
input 60 70 fire=1
input 400 401 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
